<title>JAPAN: Japan's Ikeda wants to resign over Peru - reports.</title>
<headline>Japan's Ikeda wants to resign over Peru - reports.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Foreign Minister Yukihiko Ikeda tendered his resignation to Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto on Thursday over the Peru hostage affair, news reports said.</p>
<p>But Hashimoto was trying to persuade Ikeda to stay on, Jiji and Kyodo news agencies said.</p>
</text>
